# Environment Variables — {{REPO_NAME}}

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the values.

```env
# --- Database ---
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:5432/dbname

# --- Auth ---
SESSION_SECRET=change-me-to-a-random-64-char-string

# --- OpenRouter (in-app AI features) ---
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# --- Agent Mail (2FA / inbox provisioning) ---
AGENTMAIL_API_KEY=

# --- Replit (if applicable) ---
REPLIT_ID=
PORT=5000

# --- Optional ---
# SENTRY_DSN=
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
# RESEND_API_KEY=